  ('da88b8f1-0b6f-4e69-a07f-ec1c624b2aa7', 'Reincarnation Coliseum: The Weakest Skill Conquers the Strongest Women and Creates a Harem', 'Harawata Saizou', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/da88b8f1-0b6f-4e69-a07f-ec1c624b2aa7/bf2c1b13-ca85-46f9-ac90-9d84c7e5b007.jpg', 'His grades are average. His physical fitness is average. But when it comes to games, high school student Mikagami​ Kouji is a battle-worn veteran. After being summoned to another world by a magic circle, he''s given only the Copy skill, which is derided as useless trash in this world. Enslaved as a gladiator by his summoner, Head Priestess Zayd, Mikagami is forced to fight in the horrible Battle Co', 'ongoing'),
  ('bd38c075-8b12-450a-aeee-125e3ac5da4b', 'The Strongest Hero Who Longs For Revenge Will Peerlessly Annihilate With The Power Of Darkness', 'Ononata Manimani', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/bd38c075-8b12-450a-aeee-125e3ac5da4b/9cb56f60-1442-4021-8a3b-345e48596c45.jpg', 'Raoul, who had defeated the demon king as the strongest hero, should have become the savior of the world. Having his treasured companions and family killed by power-hungry aristocrats, he was executed with false charges brought against him by the princess. Just before his life collapsed, at last, his heart fell into darkness.

“I''ll tear those traitors from limb to limb. Burn them at the stake. Se', 'ongoing'),
  ('d7037b2a-874a-4360-8a7b-07f2899152fd', 'Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun', 'Nishi Osamu ', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d7037b2a-874a-4360-8a7b-07f2899152fd/52d67301-401c-44c4-9d7b-529e2796f7d5.jpg', 'Hopeless pushover Iruma Suzuki has found himself in a devil of a predicament... His trashy parents have sold off his soul, and he now has to live and attend school in the Netherworld. But with his unique survival skills and doting demon grandfather’s support, Iruma will surely make it through this hellish experience. He''ll just need to subjugate rival classmates, summon familiars, and more, all wh', 'ongoing'),
  ('6670ee28-f26d-4b61-b49c-d71149cd5a6e', 'Mieruko-chan', 'Izumi Tomoki', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/6670ee28-f26d-4b61-b49c-d71149cd5a6e/13d41432-d7ec-41cd-a265-5af700989aa6.jpg', 'All of a sudden, Miko is able to see grotesque monsters all around her; but no one else can. Rather than trying to run away or face them, she instead musters all of her courage and... ignores them. Join in on her day-to-day life as she keeps up her best poker face despite the supernatural goings-on.
