  ('a25e46ec-30f7-4db6-89df-cacbc1d9a900', 'Horimiya', 'HERO', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/a25e46ec-30f7-4db6-89df-cacbc1d9a900/04feed00-d919-4c72-b355-15b37555eb1e.jpg', 'Kyoko Hori is your average teenage girl… who has a side she wants no one else to ever discover. Then there''s her classmate Izumi Miyamura, your average glasses-wearing boy — who''s also a totally different person outside of school. When the two unexpectedly meet, they discover each other''s secrets, and a friendship is born.

---
Hori may seem like a normal teenage girl, but she''s a completely diffe', 'completed'),
  ('ea0e7020-2b2f-4f17-9251-fee3632dc135', 'My Yandere Girlfriend Lurks in the Dungeon and Kills Me Over and Over Again', 'Kitagawa Nikita', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/ea0e7020-2b2f-4f17-9251-fee3632dc135/d22a8b43-7520-4cdd-ba1d-01beace94c1e.jpg', 'Kiska, a boy who was mistreated by the villagers, was able to get by thanks to his childhood friend, Namia, who was the only one who stood by him. One day, Namia is found murdered in the village. Kiska is framed for the murder by the other villagers, and banished to an inescapable S-class dungeon...?', 'ongoing'),
  ('9a414441-bbad-43f1-a3a7-dc262ca790a3', 'Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint', 'sing N song (싱숑)', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/9a414441-bbad-43f1-a3a7-dc262ca790a3/be18dc9a-7f1c-4ca5-b318-ffff2d7d58c3.jpg', 'Dokja was an average office worker whose sole interest was reading his favorite web novel ''Three Ways to Survive the Apocalypse.'' But when the novel suddenly becomes reality, he is the only person who knows how the world will end. Armed with this realization, Dokja uses his understanding to change the course of the story, and the world, as he knows it.', 'ongoing'),
  ('37838287-3fe9-443d-9d22-eafc1089140e', 'I Got a Cheat Skill in Another World and Became Unrivaled in the Real World, Too', 'Miku (美紅)', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/37838287-3fe9-443d-9d22-eafc1089140e/0f18c90b-fda6-4534-a1d2-028526b0a866.jpg', 'Since a young age, Tenjou Yuuya was continuously bullied. He is staying in his beloved grandfather''s home while he goes to school and, as usual, he receives a harsh bullying, and takes an extended absence from school in order to have some time to heal his wounds. While on this long time of absence, he takes the opportunity to clean his grandfather''s house and finds a room he never had seen before.', 'ongoing'),
  ('6e156d65-cf65-4d5b-9d04-52f2f8100fbf', 'Apocalypse Bringer Mynoghra: World Conquest Starts with the Civilization of Ruin', 'Kazuno Fefu', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/6e156d65-cf65-4d5b-9d04-52f2f8100fbf/03ff0d8e-8c07-42f8-9db3-49ef13ebf352.jpg', 'Bedridden and abandoned, Takuto Ira spent his days in the hospital trying to beat the illness that was slowly killing him. His only solace lay in the nation management strategy game Eternal Nations, where he had built a reputation as the greatest player to ever live. 

After succumbing to his disease, Takuto awoke within the game next to Atou — the Hero unit for his favorite civilization, Mynoghra', 'ongoing'),
  ('248525ed-ad1c-4ddc-a834-5d6ce66a3ad2', 'Arifureta: From Commonplace to World''s Strongest', 'Shirakome Ryo', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/248525ed-ad1c-4ddc-a834-5d6ce66a3ad2/637f98a9-721c-4aff-b803-b706ea90f6aa.jpg', 'Among the class transported to another world, Nagumo Hajime is an ordinary male student who didn''t have ambition nor aspiration in life, and thus called "Incompetent" by his classmates.

The class was summoned to become heroes and save a country from destruction. Students of the class were blessed with cheat specifications and cool job class, however, it was not the case with Hajime, with his prof', 'ongoing'),
  ('b0dc2f88-4e89-4e30-8d68-20116db788ff', 'Reborn as an Aristocratic Scoundrel, I Broke the Game and Mastered Magic Beyond Limits!', 'Kikuchi Kousei', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/b0dc2f88-4e89-4e30-8d68-20116db788ff/57d3bbac-efe5-4237-bd17-96d9dbc58562.jpg', 'I don''t know how it happened, but somehow I''ve died and reincarnated into my favorite academy game. And if that wasn''t weird enough, I''m now the depraved and lazy villain, Weiss Fansent, whose misdeeds lead him to a deadly end. Something I''m determined to avoid at all costs. With little time left until the academy''s entrance exams, I have no choice but to dive headfirst into serious and grueling t', 'ongoing'),
  ('1fc3d326-c037-43fa-8953-ed52a56caa18', 'She''s Likely Aiming for My Older Brother', 'Ise Maruno', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/1fc3d326-c037-43fa-8953-ed52a56caa18/d3e228a7-2cb1-4808-a08d-b862146717ca.jpg', 'A high school guy who doesn''t trust girls anymore has been tricked too many times by girls who just wanted to get close to his good-looking older brother. After all that, he decides he''ll never trust a girl again. But then, a pretty girl in his class suddenly starts talking to him a lot. Is she just trying to get to his brother too...? Or does she actually mean something else?', 'ongoing'),
  ('b4c93297-b32f-4f90-b619-55456a38b0aa', 'More than a Married Couple, but Not Lovers', 'Kanamaru Yuki', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/b4c93297-b32f-4f90-b619-55456a38b0aa/dd1804e7-56a5-4beb-90ac-d573dee7f1d1.jpg', 'Jirou, a third-year in high school, is forced to live with a gyaru named Akari under a course called the "Couple Practical". In order to be paired with their own romantic interests, they''re going to act as a married couple...!?', 'hiatus'),
  ('6f83b8fb-ca25-47c5-9d16-759dacff0a6b', 'I Was Reincarnated as the Scumbag from a Netorare Manga, But the Heroine Is Coming On to Me', 'Myon', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/6f83b8fb-ca25-47c5-9d16-759dacff0a6b/9f63c27a-c5f5-46e7-bc76-5c5a9b17365d.jpg', 'I suddenly remembered. This world is the world of an erotic manga, and that I was reincarnated as the scumbag who is supposed to steal the heroine in this world. Well, I don''t have such a hobby, so I thought the heroine should get along with the protagonist. But why are you paying attention to me, heroine?', 'ongoing'),
  ('37f5cce0-8070-4ada-96e5-fa24b1bd4ff9', 'Kaguya-sama: Love Is War', 'Akasaka Aka', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/37f5cce0-8070-4ada-96e5-fa24b1bd4ff9/e21ca520-5054-4041-a07e-de8b7c683522.jpg', 'All’s fair when love is war!  
  
Two geniuses. Two brains. Two hearts. One battle. Who will confess their love first…?!  
  
Kaguya Shinomiya and Miyuki Shirogane are two geniuses who stand atop their prestigious academy’s student council, making them the elite among elite. But it’s lonely at the top and each has fallen for the other. There’s just one huge problem standing in the way of lovey-dov', 'completed'),
  ('5f64d517-c4ea-40c0-a463-fcc069d39d3b', 'I Got a New Skill Every Time I Was Exiled, and After 100 Different Worlds, I Was Unmatched', 'Hinoura Takumi ', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/5f64d517-c4ea-40c0-a463-fcc069d39d3b/06627437-c5b3-4d56-9f2d-317d2b750855.jpg', 'An adventurer named Ed was exiled from his party because he was considered useless, but instead of being sad and upset he was actually happy!!? It turns out that it''s not without reason that he feels happy when he''s exiled from his party, because every time he''s been exiled he will receive a skill that makes him even more invincible...

Ed was given the crazy test of having to get expelled from 10', 'ongoing'),
  ('631f996b-3541-470c-9f18-ed02a447c64f', 'Redo of Healer', 'Tsukiyo Rui', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/631f996b-3541-470c-9f18-ed02a447c64f/f05e4b59-5753-4025-bd4d-5176c3422623.jpg', '"Healing magicians cannot fight alone."

