  ('64ed4d14-9e00-4b63-8799-547a508f5344', 'Parallel Paradise', 'Okamoto Lynn', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/64ed4d14-9e00-4b63-8799-547a508f5344/1268cb4a-a0ca-4425-84db-d512ecf0ecb8.jpg', 'One day at school, Youta sees someone strange entering his school. Out of nowhere this being appears next to him and makes him fall from the 3rd floor. He lands in a strange world, where beings like dragons exist! Youta meets a young paladin, and discovers that he is the only man inhabiting that planet, and that its inhabitants are extremely ''weak'' to his presence. Could this be paradise?', 'ongoing'),
  ('1487ed38-87b4-4f47-a82b-e85fd3dbd4f0', 'A Warrior Exiled by the Hero and His Lover', 'Tokugawa Lemon', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/1487ed38-87b4-4f47-a82b-e85fd3dbd4f0/a9822b4b-b7bd-444e-bbab-63fe1bbc76d3.jpg', 'After losing his girlfriend to a brave hero, Toru is expelled from his S-Rank party. With a feeling of sadness and pain in his heart, he defeats a demon he meets outside the city, and his ability [to save experience] is broken! Toru becomes level 300 in the blink of an eye! With this power that far surpasses that of heroes, there is nothing that can stop him. Kaede, a slave he met on his journey, ', 'ongoing'),
  ('600f467c-9613-4056-aa21-bb2ecc295b84', 'I''m Sick and Tired of My Childhood Friend''s, Now Girlfriend''s, Constant Abuse, so I Broke up With Her', 'Ononata Manimani', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/600f467c-9613-4056-aa21-bb2ecc295b84/fceb5b60-abea-458a-bbf6-d4c0b6eb4222.jpg', 'My childhood friend is also my girlfriend. A dream come true, right? Hell no. She insults me on a daily basis. She grinds my dignity into shreds and it takes a toll on my mental well-being. I can''t take it anymore. So I''m left with no choice, I''m going to break up with her. In order to maintain my sanity, it''s the only option.', 'ongoing'),
  ('e86f3c88-c91d-40a4-acbf-afaafedd4690', 'The Cursed Sword Master''s Harem Life: By the Sword, For the Sword, Cursed Sword Master', 'Fukuryuu', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/e86f3c88-c91d-40a4-acbf-afaafedd4690/57c2c9af-e95e-420e-acdd-b3e5d38358fa.jpg', 'Fujinomiya Soujirou is transported to a fantasy world with only his Daisho (pair of samurai swords) in hand. The katana can talk and swiftly informs him that it is Hotarumaru, the legendary national treasure of Japan thought lost during World War II. The wakizashi is too young to have a voice, so Souji names it Sakura. This is the story of Souji and Hotarumaru''s journey through a new world as he s', 'ongoing'),
  ('6c62d637-4004-426f-ba7f-be45e18941b6', 'Delinquent High School Girl Kuzuhana-chan', 'Sogabe Toshinori', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/6c62d637-4004-426f-ba7f-be45e18941b6/954f2271-489c-48c7-b4ee-6e819f481a1d.jpg', 'At the beginning of the academic year, Saotome Hodaka enrolls into Moteshiro Prefectural High School, a former all-girls school that had recently integrated, but discovers it has a male to female ratio of 1:359! While most might think of this as a paradise, the majority of the students are delinquents and Saotome immediately finds himself being extorted by some of the more aggressive girls. Howeve', 'ongoing'),
  ('af38f328-8df1-4b4c-a272-e737625c3ddc', 'My Senpai is Annoying', 'Shiro Manta', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/af38f328-8df1-4b4c-a272-e737625c3ddc/a3673b0d-7bab-42ff-aab0-c4c54c9fc563.jpg', 'Futaba Igarashi is a diminutive office lady who finds that her towering and boisterous work senpai Harumi Takeda always gets in her hair, but he always has her back, he always keeps her company, and she starts noticing that her heart is slowly veering towards him…

Won 1st place in the 2018 Next Manga Awards Web Category.
