  ('61830b36-1712-4b7b-9421-f671e9ced6d3', 'Learning to Love My Cat-like Classmate', 'Akinoko', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/61830b36-1712-4b7b-9421-f671e9ced6d3/6076a7f6-4454-49fb-8802-89ee00aec545.jpg', 'Minato Seno''s high school life had just begun when his homeroom teacher requested his help with Nekozane, the cat-like chronic napper who sits next to him in class. Timid and socially anxious, Minato has never talked to her or even seen her face. But when he finally musters up the courage to wake Nekozane, she unexpectedly hugs him on the spot! Thus begins a sweet tale of two teens awkwardly stumb', 'ongoing'),
  ('18d92807-8627-4a23-9ef6-12a0a7fbd054', 'Did You Think You Could Live Normally Even in a World With a 1:5 Male-to-Female Ratio?: When Deeply Intense Feelings of the Girls are Toyed With by an Oblivious Boy', 'Koutaro Mifuji', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/18d92807-8627-4a23-9ef6-12a0a7fbd054/db022440-c042-4225-8ba8-cd64d752f7aa.jpg', 'Before he knew it, Masato had been transported to a world where there were just a few more women than in his original world. However, aside from the fact that women were a little more assertive, the world wasn''t much different from the one he came from... or so he thought. Little did he know, the kindness he spread, based on the standards of his old world, was saving those around him more than he ', 'ongoing'),
  ('16dcfceb-4382-45f1-adb0-d57fc5ea0d06', 'My Death Flags Show No Sign of Ending', 'Izumi', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/16dcfceb-4382-45f1-adb0-d57fc5ea0d06/410068a9-c618-479c-bb39-817430514b0e.jpg', 'When he came to his senses, Hirasawa Kazuki, a normal university student, found himself in possession of the body of a game''s character. Moreover, it was Harold Stokes, the story''s most hated character who was even given the title "King of Trash" by the players. Myriads of landmines are just waiting for him to step on them, like death flags! Will Harold be able to clear the survival route while av', 'ongoing'),
  ('4a973243-952e-44d7-a50f-883b4b7c9cc2', 'SSS-Class Revival Hunter', 'Neida (네이다)', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/4a973243-952e-44d7-a50f-883b4b7c9cc2/9adafa19-0424-4677-aab4-93a07a01a591.jpg', 'In the mysterious, RPG dungeon-like Tower, Gongja Kim lives a mundane existence, envying all the star hunters. One day, his wish for more is granted with a legendary skill to copy others’ abilities… at the cost of his life. Before he can make sense of it, he’s killed by the #1 hunter, the Flame Emperor! But this activates his skill and now he’s copied a new one, the ability to travel back in time ', 'ongoing'),
  ('cf7b7869-3d9a-4c4d-bd06-249eba113558', 'Until the Gal and I Become a Married Couple', 'Shino (しの)', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/cf7b7869-3d9a-4c4d-bd06-249eba113558/5b978b74-b18f-4039-a972-fa51d15e5d12.jpg', 'Saku Kanakura was a boy born into a poor household. He studied hard and managed to pass the exam to an excellent high school but, it soon turned out that his parents were in debt! When it was time to pay the debt off, a mysterious gal appeared and offered to pay off their debt. A big burden was almost off Kanakura''s head, but the gal made a condition in return which stated that—', 'cancelled'),
  ('23a84f79-368c-44ca-8a8f-57103b9a5628', 'Let''s Manage the Tower', 'Soushuu', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/23a84f79-368c-44ca-8a8f-57103b9a5628/a54c622d-59f2-49c8-8666-7e7bc436937a.jpg', 'Kosuke is killed by a truck, his soul is lost in a garden with two beautiful girls. The owner of the place will let him choose whether he will be reborn or summoned to another world, and he maintains the summons. In this new world, the main two girls who were created by the owner of the garden to help him find the mystery behind the world - a Dungeon tower. Will he be able to become the owner of t', 'ongoing'),
  ('0d4f9dba-f55f-4ff7-9f49-52311939504e', 'From Old Country Bumpkin to Master Swordsman: My Hotshot Disciples are All Grown Up Now, and They Won''t Leave Me Alone', 'Nabeshima Tetsuhiro', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/0d4f9dba-f55f-4ff7-9f49-52311939504e/956a54b7-3ad9-4640-a9bc-35405127e87f.jpg', 'Middle-aged Beryl Gardinant has only ever accomplished one thing: running a humble sword-fighting dojo in the quiet countryside. But when he''s paid a visit by his former pupil, Allusia, he discovers that she has become an elite commander — and she''s hardly the only ex-student who’s a renowned warrior! Now forced by Allusia to become a special instructor to the strongest order of knights in the kin', 'ongoing'),
  ('7cd3ca23-2d70-4c03-99f0-b1ee848c4dc4', 'Yakuza Reincarnation', 'Takeshi Natsuhara', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/7cd3ca23-2d70-4c03-99f0-b1ee848c4dc4/d0f69b06-a5ca-4b12-bb3f-2115b7bed3e7.jpg', 'An old school yakuza, Nagamasa Ryumatsu, ended up losing his life due to certain circumstances. But, when he awakened to a strange sort of scenery he had never seen before, he found that he had somehow changed into a beautiful girl?!', 'ongoing'),
  ('ee96e2b7-9af2-4864-9656-649f4d3b6fec', 'Gals Can''t Be Kind to Otaku!?', 'Norishiro-chan', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/ee96e2b7-9af2-4864-9656-649f4d3b6fec/1ad73486-bf1f-492b-a821-86c3414110ac.jpg', 'Takuya Seo is an otaku who likes "anime for girls" and can''t say he likes it out loud. One day, he gets involved with two gals from his class, Amane and Ijichi, but it seems that Amane is also an otaku...', 'ongoing'),
  ('ec8f26f4-bc9f-43b6-93ec-60a05638fca0', 'Different World Foundation', 'Sakuragi Sakura', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/ec8f26f4-bc9f-43b6-93ec-60a05638fca0/1129a0b1-0704-46c2-b562-f637b42ca843.jpg', 'A protagonist reborn in another world. Apparently he had been reincarnated as an abandoned child. Before his eyes were abandoned children like him. In order to survive, he led them into farming. Little by little, orphans gathered, and upon hearing rumors of a village, others began to migrate. The group that had been nothing but children had become a village before anyone realized. Then various cou', 'ongoing'),
  ('f0bbac64-efe5-4403-9fcf-5454db36467a', 'Virgin Knight Who Is the Frontier Lord in the Gender-Switched World', 'Mitizou', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/f0bbac64-efe5-4403-9fcf-5454db36467a/1a541307-2e71-4bcc-928f-ec11c73e8977.jpg', 'Reborn from modern Japan into a medieval fantasy world where gender roles are flipped, Faust is an anomaly—a rare male knight! Raised as a frontier lord, his old-world values clash hilariously with his new life. The queen''s attire leaves little to the imagination, and the busty duke''s "friendly" advances verge on harassment! Despite getting flustered in court, Faust is a dazzling hero on the battl', 'ongoing'),
  ('136a8c13-cf72-427a-8d76-23f1bf070c0e', 'I’m a “Behemoth,” an S-Ranked Monster, but Mistaken for a Cat, I Live as an Elf Girl’s Pet', 'Ginyoku Nozomi', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/136a8c13-cf72-427a-8d76-23f1bf070c0e/d314c3ba-69ec-40b3-8a9c-320122d47d03.jpg', 'You''ve got to be kitten me!

A proud knight, slain in battle, finds himself alive once more-reincarnated in the body of a fearsome behemoth. As if he wasn''t confused enough by this turn of events, apparently behemoth cubs look exactly like adorable kittens?! Even if the rest of the world sees him as soft and cuddly, he has the honor of a noble warrior and the strength of an unstoppable S-ranked mo', 'ongoing'),
  ('6cc0f7c2-0db6-432b-8189-fcedbcdda888', 'Hitomi-chan is Shy with Strangers', 'Natsumi Cyorisuke', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/6cc0f7c2-0db6-432b-8189-fcedbcdda888/f96219a8-66d9-45b9-91aa-d5493c2f2542.jpg', 'One day, the ordinary 2nd year high schooler Yuu Usami accidentally encounters a big girl with a scary look. Turns out she''s glaring at him, but why...!? Although Hitomi Takano looks like she''s scary and awkward, she''s actually a kind and adorable girl.', 'completed'),
  ('2fec6641-beb1-4ae9-a32f-204dd06688ac', 'The Angel Next Door Spoils Me Rotten', 'Saeki-san', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/2fec6641-beb1-4ae9-a32f-204dd06688ac/e67c63bf-2cf8-465f-82ea-9aa8282a0857.jpg', 'Mahiru is a beautiful girl whose classmates all call her an "angel." Not only is she a star athlete with perfect grades—she''s also drop-dead gorgeous. Amane‚ an average guy and self-admitted slob‚ has never thought much of the divine beauty‚ despite attending the same school. Everything changes‚ however‚ when he happens to see Mahiru sitting alone in a park during a rainstorm.', 'ongoing'),
  ('ee4c0acd-dc97-44a1-bebe-040cf79b62bd', 'Isekai NTR: Sullying My Best Friend''s Women with the Strongest Skill', 'Gorillan Do', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/ee4c0acd-dc97-44a1-bebe-040cf79b62bd/61cf6ea1-3e04-40d1-8f90-74271edcb0cb.jpg', 'This shitty world that''s nothing but a trashy game, he and I will definitely escape it together. So, all these annoying women trying to take advantage of him are just a nuisance. What''s worse, it seems like he''s beginning to have some feelings for them. That''s why, for his sake, I''ll eat them up first. But, just what is this power...?', 'ongoing'),
  ('2674b676-f69b-4fea-b5eb-d19803d41fce', 'Imaizumi Brings All the Gals to His House', 'Nori5rou', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/2674b676-f69b-4fea-b5eb-d19803d41fce/3a50d8b5-b0de-4443-8e26-b3a4faf5bdeb.jpg', 'During the day, Imaizumi attends his classes like any dutiful student, only to return each evening to a home full of hotties! It seems his home has become the go-to hangout for the coolest gyarus in town. From endless gossip fests to snack binges to getting downright physical with his three new housemates, his once-quiet abode is now buzzing with non-stop energy and exciting escapades. Can Imaizum', 'ongoing'),
  ('d042e605-a07a-4cd2-87d5-ebe53c0b135f', 'The Monster Girl I Saved.', 'Okinosuke', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d042e605-a07a-4cd2-87d5-ebe53c0b135f/f77dc36a-46c8-4b4b-b990-22fcb80e9834.jpg', 'Some 20 years have passed since the protagonist was summoned to another world and retired from the army. He is still single in his 40s and lives as a low-ranking professor, until one day, an elite "monster girl" transfers into his class.', 'ongoing'),
  ('1d330951-583e-423e-9cd7-abcd6f761f53', 'My Older Sister''s Friend', 'Takase Waka', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/1d330951-583e-423e-9cd7-abcd6f761f53/3a4be129-31d9-4346-b678-cae7cc917ce2.jpg', 'Hinako, a friend of Asahi''s older sister, is a frequent guest at the home of the high school boy. She always misleads his mind with her suggestive attitude while treating him like a little brother... or rather, pet?
___
**Note:** Chapters 1 & 2 can be found in the [pre-serialization](https://mangadex.org/title/abad18cf-bf72-4bbc-97c8-b55dfa28f9b9/ane-no-yuujin).', 'ongoing'),
  ('1044287a-73df-48d0-b0b2-5327f32dd651', 'JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure: Part 7–Steel Ball Run - Digital Colored Comics', 'Araki Hirohiko', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/1044287a-73df-48d0-b0b2-5327f32dd651/92e82cbb-de1e-47f0-a3ae-22f480a59994.jpg', 'In the American Old West, the world''s greatest race is about to begin. Thousands line up in San Diego to travel over six thousand kilometers for a chance to win the grand prize of fifty million dollars. With the era of the horse reaching its end, contestants are allowed to use any kind of vehicle they wish. Competitors will have to endure grueling conditions, traveling up to a hundred kilometers a', 'completed'),
  ('da7bb886-7e6b-4174-83a9-2c478475b846', 'Parallel World Pharmacy', 'Takayama Liz', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/da7bb886-7e6b-4174-83a9-2c478475b846/844f1206-5a0a-4dc7-8ce0-0d02dad6aea9.jpg', 'When a young pharmacologist gives his life to his research and dies from overwork, he finds himself reincarnated as a boy named Farma, the son of a court physician. In this new world where faulty remedies run rampant, Farma uses his knowledge of modern pharmacology and his cheat powers to cure all of the diseases around him. (Edited One Peace Books)
