  ('4022b517-658e-4dc8-978c-bc84d5fc3457', 'Second Life in Another World', 'Mine', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/4022b517-658e-4dc8-978c-bc84d5fc3457/a34d7966-b945-4861-b2b0-74f67cc8e091.jpg', '“Kunugi Renya-san, you have passed away!”

After passing away at the age of 94, Kunugi Renya is asked by a girl who seems like god to live a second life in another world. How can he enjoy his new life when the mission he''s given is lame—!?  
