  ('d1a9fdeb-f713-407f-960c-8326b586e6fd', 'Vagabond', 'Inoue Takehiko', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d1a9fdeb-f713-407f-960c-8326b586e6fd/05f8dcb4-8ea1-48db-a0b1-3a8fbf695e5a.jpg', 'Growing up in the late 16th century Sengoku era Japan, Shinmen Takezou is shunned by the local villagers as a devil child due to his wild and violent nature. Running away from home with a fellow boy at age 17, Takezo joins the Toyotomi army to fight the Tokugawa clan at the Battle of Sekigahara. However, the Tokugawa win a crushing victory, leading to nearly three hundred years of Shogunate rule. ', 'hiatus'),
  ('d8f9afe2-aa44-4bc6-9145-eebb1f282372', 'Pseudo Harem', 'Saitou Yuu', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d8f9afe2-aa44-4bc6-9145-eebb1f282372/8cc1aa08-c214-44ab-8b59-dcce6f73ca84.jpg', 'The story of Nanakura Rin of the Drama Club, who has indisputable talent as an actress, and her senpai in the same club, Kitahama Eiji. With the power of her acting, Rin teases Eiji with a variety of personas, giving him the harem he''s always dreamed of!', 'completed'),
  ('1f9fb803-733a-4104-bea3-f4b449da5e3c', 'My Neighbor Ms. Kurokawa', 'Itou Kyousuke', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/1f9fb803-733a-4104-bea3-f4b449da5e3c/72dd340d-ae06-47f5-b56c-31aea9db5d1f.jpg', '_The secret between me and her is trivial yet important._

Hajime Takahashi, enrolled in Shuubi High School solely because it''s the sacred place of his favorite manga. Everywhere in the school are locations that appeared in the manga, and he''s super excited! Amidst this excitement, Takahashi meets a beautiful girl, Yayoi Kurokawa, who looks just like the heroine from his favorite work, and they co', 'ongoing'),
  ('643561e6-5c27-4382-95d3-8e84894a3fb6', 'My Love Story with Yamada-kun at Lv999', 'Mashiro (msr7025)', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/643561e6-5c27-4382-95d3-8e84894a3fb6/7d185ef1-a06c-47c5-b181-5a081cb537ef.jpg', 'Recently dumped, Akane is just about to quit the game she used to play with her boyfriend when she meets Yamada in the same RPG. Yamada in real life turns out to be somewhat of a legend. The only problem is - he is ONLY interested in the game. As Akane''s feelings grow, will Yamada''s focus stay on the game?
___
The manga won the Tsutaya Comic Award in 2022.', 'hiatus'),
  ('7df2d2d6-34b2-4ff7-8a3a-f6b5a9d546ed', 'When I Started Streaming in Another World, I Ended Up Creating a Large Number of Yandere Followers', 'Myon', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/7df2d2d6-34b2-4ff7-8a3a-f6b5a9d546ed/9967a02a-54cc-4b1d-8d4e-6d49a91148f9.jpg', 'Living in Ataraxia, a world of swords and magic, a reincarnated individual decided to make a living out of streaming. Living in a world where such a thing did not exist despite the many forms of entertainment, he quickly made a name for himself. This is not the tale of just a streamer... but of a boy who becomes a legend as a haishinsha.', 'ongoing'),
  ('0cf1c1c7-2894-4b4d-a3cc-3e1501fb3e36', 'My Ex-Wife is Young Again and She''s in my Class', 'Nekomata Nuko', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/0cf1c1c7-2894-4b4d-a3cc-3e1501fb3e36/f36d00f5-5cf8-417b-91ea-366ac37230ed.jpg', 'On the way home after filing for divorce, Kohei Kurose is hit by a car and is transported back in time to his high school days! Determined to enjoy his new life, he heads back to his high school, only to find his ex-wife, Yuzuka, there...?', 'completed'),
  ('45d3ebca-8d74-4e51-be90-8582e4756cbd', 'Let’s Run an Inn on Dungeon Island! (In a World Ruled by Women)', 'Bunzaburo Nagano', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/45d3ebca-8d74-4e51-be90-8582e4756cbd/1dabf13a-bc6b-4a55-94e4-b237e8b87c34.jpg', 'Sanada Shirou thought escaping his dead-end corporate job would mean peace at last—until he wakes up in a world where women rule the battlefield and men are treated like fragile treasures. Gifted with creation magic, Shirou figures the smart move is to open a cozy inn and live the slow life he''s always wanted. But "slow" doesn''t last long when the fiercest fighters and boldest beauties of this mat', 'ongoing'),
  ('129c90ca-b997-4789-a748-e8765bc67a65', 'The Tsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsundere Girl Getting Less and Less Tsun Day by Day', 'Yaki Tomato', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/129c90ca-b997-4789-a748-e8765bc67a65/bd5e1721-3a5b-4760-b7d7-ef1818002108.jpg', 'The tsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsuntsundere girl getting less and less tsun day by day.

