**Assistant:** [Kotatsu (小龍)](https://mangadex.org/author/08d882f4-7655-41ec-8645-1594ca8d5b31/kotatsu)', 'completed'),
  ('1aaa0a4b-78bc-4f39-aa20-145766f83092', 'Welcome to Japan, Ms. Elf!', 'Makishima Suzuki', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/1aaa0a4b-78bc-4f39-aa20-145766f83092/f70a6666-3733-43e7-a195-db8bff0bf2db.jpg', 'Kitase Kazuhiro is an ordinary salaryman who always leaves the office on time. Though this is Japan, so perhaps he''s not really ordinary after all. What''s truly strange comes after that; Every night, he takes a shower, changes into his pyjamas and has a good night''s sleep. Then he dreams of a fantasy world, and only wakes up when he dies or sleeps in that world. One day, he''s killed after stumblin', 'ongoing'),
  ('fac7bdc7-c1f3-4595-82f5-b5bfb002b933', 'The Ideal Sponger Life', 'Watanabe Tsunehiko', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/fac7bdc7-c1f3-4595-82f5-b5bfb002b933/e167eae9-79c5-4467-b07c-e18d5f4c36ae.jpg', 'One day, average salaryman Yamai Zenjirou has an out-of-this-world experience—literally! He''s pulled from Earth and dragged to another world where magic thrives and a gorgeous, powerful queen needs a consort. Now he''s being pressured to marry that very monarch and help her bear a child. Will Zenjirou accept this life of lazy, luxurious love at the cost of leaving his home behind?', 'ongoing'),
  ('722a45c0-5e55-40f2-929b-ff69b0989edb', 'Who Made Me a Princess', 'Spoon (스푼)', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/722a45c0-5e55-40f2-929b-ff69b0989edb/1b24d6dc-04a2-466b-a5d7-b86dde5087d3.jpg', 'When I opened my eyes, I had become a princess! But out of all the characters from this romance novel to be reborn into, why must it be the princess whose fate it is to die by the hands of her own blood-related father, the emperor?! If I want to live, I must never enter his sight. However…  

