  ('e3d88382-a2c4-4958-8311-f8bd9a3f1e21', 'The Golden Word Master: The Four Heroes and the Innocent Bystander with the Unique Cheat', 'Tomoto Sui', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/e3d88382-a2c4-4958-8311-f8bd9a3f1e21/02c3457a-4c68-458d-9eb0-47a3dd23320d.jpg', 'In an RPG-like fantasy world consumed by warring nations and racial discrimination, the human kingdom summons five high school students from 21st-century Japan for assistance in their conflict with the demonkin. Now those students, with their experience of MMORPGs at their disposal, will hone their skills to protect the human kingdom of Edea.  
  
