  ('6d02e579-b0db-4240-98e9-e68e458f8dfc', 'My House Is a Magic Power Spot: Just by Living There I Become the Strongest in the World', 'Amaui Shiroichi', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/6d02e579-b0db-4240-98e9-e68e458f8dfc/dab1e191-2ef4-4339-8e02-69c7dd3d156e.jpg', 'Living carefree at home is the greatest shortcut—my house is the world''s greatest Magic Power Spot. That being the case, both my house and I were summoned to another world by some guys who were aiming for it. However, I''ve been living in this place for many years and my body is, apparently, abnormally overflowing with magic. Due to some unforeseen circumstances by those guys who summoned me, they ', 'completed'),
  ('65498ee8-3c32-4228-b433-73a4d08f8927', 'Monster Musume: Everyday Life with Monster Girls', 'Inui Takemaru (Okayado)', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/65498ee8-3c32-4228-b433-73a4d08f8927/38428151-2be4-42af-9a0e-c64c26720a28.jpg', 'What do world governments do when they learn that fantastical beings are not merely fiction, but flesh and blood-not to mention feather, hoof, and fang? Why, they create new regulations, of course, like the Interspecies Cultural Exchange Accord! When twenty-something Kimihito Kurusu becomes an involuntary “volunteer” in the government homestay program for monster girls, his world is turned upside ', 'ongoing'),
  ('30eb9ee7-4cfe-4036-95f9-4aac5e05b505', 'A NEET’s Guide to the Parallel World: Healer, the Strongest Cheat?', 'Joryu Romero', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/30eb9ee7-4cfe-4036-95f9-4aac5e05b505/69f77ae2-629c-4b02-ae80-d4445c02e335.jpg', 'Hidako Masamune is a high school student who suffers from continuous bullying by his classmates. Becoming tired of it all, he decides to commit suicide, but instead he is transported to another world along with all his classmates. When they arrive, they find that they now possess amazing abilities but he was only granted the status of a "healer," the weakest skill of all. The king decides to get r', 'ongoing'),
  ('cc121572-858e-4bd2-b5f3-ef505eca0081', 'Hazure Skill: The Guild Member with a Worthless Skill Is Actually a Legendary Assassin', 'Kennoji', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/cc121572-858e-4bd2-b5f3-ef505eca0081/09086f02-ba9d-4723-9849-9b4e215dc409.jpg', 'Roland is an assassin who, one day, breaks from his team and single-handedly "kills" the demon king. After returning to the kingdom, the king graciously promises Roland whatever he wants for his heroics. Conflicted in his desires - he hasn''t thought of anything outside of killing for years - he remembers that one of his teammates told him what she plans to do after evil is defeated: Live an ordina', 'ongoing'),
  ('cbb22826-963e-4602-a5cd-a50c75723d59', 'Magic Stone Gourmet: Eating Magical Power Made Me the Strongest', 'Yuuki Ryou', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/cbb22826-963e-4602-a5cd-a50c75723d59/b44373d2-e580-4241-9e0c-894d40738c7c.jpg', 'A reincarnated boy with a secret skill aims to become the great king!

Ein reincarnated as a noble with the skill "Toxin Decomposition EX". The skill was not something he wanted, so he was disappointed... but then learns that he has a very rare talent to absorb magic power by eating magic stones. They even taste good! He then found out that his real identity was a prince of the largest kingdom of ', 'ongoing'),
  ('0976963e-c0b4-4bdc-abde-831e9cb29cc2', 'Damedol and the Only Fan in the World', 'Kishirimo', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/0976963e-c0b4-4bdc-abde-831e9cb29cc2/b7adbbb1-170a-42be-a379-99aecaeded03.jpg', 'Urumin may be an idol—but she can’t sing, can’t dance, and her attitude is anything but sweet. And yet, she has one loyal supporter: Kimiya, her only fan in the entire world. Their relationship isn’t quite like your typical idol-and-fan story… in fact, it’s a little weird!?

