  ('732dc0ec-bdba-431b-9be1-40ca1d235dd4', 'My Daughters, S-Rank Adventurers, Have a Severe Obsession with Their Father', 'Tomobashi Kametsu', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/732dc0ec-bdba-431b-9be1-40ca1d235dd4/0c4acf97-ae96-4fee-81e0-ce3de559c2a0.jpg', 'The youngest A-rank adventurer, child prodigy Kaiser, finds three babies who were the only survivor of a destroyed village. Then he decided to give up his job as an adventurer and raise them. Over time, the girls grow brightly and show exceptional talents in fencing, magic and management. However, these girls also seem to love their father, Kaiser!', 'ongoing'),
  ('b787bfae-7b1c-4964-a910-718529bbd377', 'My Daughter Left the Nest and Returned an S-Rank Adventurer: The Black-Haired Valkyrie', 'MOJIKAKIYA', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/b787bfae-7b1c-4964-a910-718529bbd377/843f5fef-057b-4856-8346-ea08881239bf.jpg', 'Retired adventurer Belgrieve thought he was done with excitement… but his peaceful life is upended when he discovers a baby abandoned in the nearby woods. As her adoptive father, he teaches his new daughter Angeline everything he knows about the adventuring life—a past he had thought long forgotten after he lost his leg in battle. Angeline idolizes her father and wants to follow in his footsteps, ', 'ongoing'),
  ('77dbfa29-8ef0-446d-82cc-1b4de878dd90', 'My Instant Death Ability Is So Overpowered, No One in This Other World Stands a Chance Against Me! —AΩ—', 'Fujitaka Tsuyoshi', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/77dbfa29-8ef0-446d-82cc-1b4de878dd90/ede50d76-a30c-40a1-a6f0-d562983b57f1.jpg', 'Growth cheats? Infinite magic power? The ability to utilize all archetypes? What’s the point if instant death ends everything with a single attack? 
 
Awaking to absolute chaos and carnage while on a school trip, Yogiri Takatou discovers that everyone in his class has been transported to another world!

He had somehow managed to sleep through the entire ordeal himself, missing out on the Gift — po', 'ongoing'),
  ('046746c9-8872-4797-a112-318642fdb272', 'The Delinquent Girl Beside Me Suddenly Dyed Her Hair Black', 'Teika', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/046746c9-8872-4797-a112-318642fdb272/2aa51a93-aeec-4197-a795-50ffe86703d4.jpg', '"I dyed my hair black for you... so notice me."

Shimizu-san, the delinquent highschool girl who sits next to Hondo with her newly-dyed hair, gradually lowered her voice, slightly blushed, and laid her face down on the desk. After that, when Daiki Hondo talked with his friend about how he wanted be with a girl who can cook, the next day Hondo ended up partnered with Shimizu-san in cooking class, e', 'ongoing'),
  ('b6b89f54-81c1-4e7e-ae80-b4dccdd63ada', 'The Case Where I Followed the Freezing Lady and She Doted on Me Like Crazy', 'Aisaka Takato', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/b6b89f54-81c1-4e7e-ae80-b4dccdd63ada/e8366f62-bef1-4c27-9b09-dca089a9a9f6.jpg', 'Alicia Ozrind, known in noble circles as the Frost Duchess, is feared for her cold and unyielding demeanor, earning her the reputation of a villainess among the aristocracy. But beneath her icy exterior lies a girl who simply struggles to express her true feelings. There is, however, one person who has melted her frozen heart—a young servant named Gray, who works as a cleaner in her grand estate.
', 'ongoing'),
  ('81d75b43-c7bf-4102-86ae-d07b93cf074a', 'What Happens When You Save Two Beautiful Sisters Who Hate Men Without Telling Them Your Name?', 'Myon', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/81d75b43-c7bf-4102-86ae-d07b93cf074a/fdd75314-cd65-4121-84cd-aacfdea56f8c.jpg', 'Arisa and Aina are beautiful sisters who are famous for their dislike of men. Hayato, a classmate who happened to be involved with the two, will receive "special treatment" from the girls who are supposed to hate men―?! 

