**Character Designer:** [Giuniu](https://mangadex.org/author/657f488c-ba3d-4910-8ec3', 'ongoing'),
  ('d8f1d7da-8bb1-407b-8be3-10ac2894d3c6', 'Isekai Uncle', 'Hotondo Shindeiru', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d8f1d7da-8bb1-407b-8be3-10ac2894d3c6/9217ea22-437a-4c99-b5f2-d6f4527017c3.jpg', 'Having survived an isekai for 17 years, 34 year old Ojisan (uncle) returns to modern day Japan. Takafumi, Ojisan''s nephew, now gets to witness what throwing a diehard Sega fan into an isekai for 17 years does to various things and people, both past and present.', 'ongoing'),
  ('65263bf9-4f87-4513-b72f-ad6436b3911c', 'Wotakoi: Love Is Hard for Otaku', 'Fujita', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/65263bf9-4f87-4513-b72f-ad6436b3911c/b7f78e11-c910-48bb-a842-798e04f0f92f.jpg', 'Narumi Momose has had it rough: every boyfriend she’s had dumped her once they found out she was an otaku, so she’s gone to great lengths to hide it. When a chance meeting at her new job with childhood friend, fellow otaku, and now coworker Hirotaka Nifuji almost gets her secret outed at work, she comes up with a plan to make sure he never speaks up. But he comes up with a counter-proposal: why do', 'completed'),
  ('a892e04c-e20c-4fd3-9169-d620cee8dbd4', 'A Divorced Crybaby Has Moved in Next Door', 'Zyugoya', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/a892e04c-e20c-4fd3-9169-d620cee8dbd4/ef198af6-ef6c-4cf5-bee4-5ffeb6d102d0.jpg', 'Ochiai-San is an ordinary woman who recently went through a divorce. Years of marital neglect have chipped away at her self-esteem, making her more reserved and depressed. However, there is one light at the end of her tunnel - her next door neighbor, Sawatari-kun. Can he help bring her back out of her shell?', 'completed'),
  ('7b8b6e71-2fc9-4219-b2a0-53af9b78384b', 'Secret Rites with the Holy Maidens', 'Hirameki Bonjin', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/7b8b6e71-2fc9-4219-b2a0-53af9b78384b/836d3e27-b845-409c-935b-30a38b947a00.jpg', '"Please teach us naughty things."

One day, Itsuki is transported to another world, where he is confronted by sisters who serve the goddess. In order to return to the real world, he must give them practical sex education!', 'ongoing'),
  ('80422e14-b9ad-4fda-970f-de370d5fa4e5', 'Made in Abyss', 'Tsukushi Akihito', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/80422e14-b9ad-4fda-970f-de370d5fa4e5/462c827f-b23a-4e7a-ae4e-6954c2fd5757.jpg', 'The enormous cave system, known as the Abyss, is the last unexplored place in the world. Nobody knows how deep down goes this titanic pit, inhabited by strange and wondrous creatures and full of mysterious ancient relics which purpose in unknown to modern man. Generations of bold adventurers have been drawn by the cryptic depths of the Abyss. In course of time those brave enough to explore the dan', 'ongoing'),
  ('af66b380-623e-4dfc-9fbb-8ca093b9d5a9', 'Asumi-chan is Interested in Lesbian Brothels!', 'Itsuki Kuro', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/af66b380-623e-4dfc-9fbb-8ca093b9d5a9/36274106-6bd7-43a9-808b-f93edd94bd95.jpg', 'Sweet but awkward college student Asumi never got over her childhood crush on her old friend Mai. Their first and only kiss couldn’t have gone worse. So when she learns that Mai may be working at a nearby brothel, she sets her sights on redemption! But there’s one catch: none of the women on the brothel’s website use full photos or real names. Thus begins a journey of self-discovery and sexual exp', 'ongoing'),
  ('d7d6829b-ceab-4346-a033-22387aeff297', 'Summoned to Another World... Again?!', 'Kishimoto Kazuha', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d7d6829b-ceab-4346-a033-22387aeff297/39fba252-afce-465d-8b3b-603514261956.jpg', 'There was once a man who was summoned to another world, and saved it. Of course, he became too popular there, and turned into an isekai-normie. However, that man fell into a "trap", and was forcibly returned to his original world. Moreover, he had to start over as a baby!', 'ongoing'),
  ('4028472c-5ee4-4e5a-9d61-6aea6449edd9', 'Boyish Girlfriend', 'Gyuunyuu Mugigohan', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/4028472c-5ee4-4e5a-9d61-6aea6449edd9/770a1e1b-b893-4fe6-969c-5e39da2c3ab0.jpg', 'Akira is boyish in both looks and personality—and Daichi, her childhood friend turned boyfriend by their first year of high school, thinks she''s too cute. Girly outfits aren''t her thing... so why does he suddenly find her in a cat-eared maid costume at the school festival?! Awkward but sweet moments abound in this wholesome friends-to-lovers romcom.

