  ('4c28fa92-d88a-4686-b068-348c4e72f3e1', 'The Simple-Looking Sword Saint Is Nevertheless the Strongest', 'Akashi Rokurou', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/4c28fa92-d88a-4686-b068-348c4e72f3e1/f86d3463-6ce4-4ef9-b3ed-fe8983ab0226.jpg', 'Shirokuro Sansui, a Japanese student, was accidentally killed by God, then sent to another world in apology. There, he received training from a sage for 500 years in order to become "the strongest." After training enough to be considered the strongest by the world''s current standards, he happened upon a baby near his training grounds, thus beginning his otherworld adventure. His training was norma', 'ongoing'),
