  ('5439fe65-5b3a-420e-9ef4-27c9bcc49c5a', 'Boy''s Abyss', 'Minenami Ryo', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/5439fe65-5b3a-420e-9ef4-27c9bcc49c5a/9ac1a624-2f11-4ef5-b129-ba829fd95040.jpg', 'In a town with nothing, in the middle of a daily life with seemingly no signs of change, high schooler Reiji Kurose was "just" living. Family, dreams for the future, childhood friends were all binding him down to that city. He thought he would "just" keep on living like that. Until he met her. Is there hope in living? Is there light waiting ahead?', 'completed'),
  ('d36bea9f-853f-4908-9957-5514b1903e36', 'Marika’s Love Meter Malfunction', 'Komugi Rin', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d36bea9f-853f-4908-9957-5514b1903e36/4b5daf86-5fc1-4316-ba94-cb96f093bd89.jpg', 'I''ve gained the ability to see the affection levels of the girl I like. I don''t have the courage to confess my feelings to my childhood friend, Marika-chan. One day, I made a strong wish upon a shooting star: "I wish I could understand the feelings of others, like in a dating game." Then, that wish came true...!? Floating above the girls in my class are affection meters. While confused by this sur', 'ongoing'),
  ('ebea2cf5-ce6c-4586-b2ad-a414fc7e0d22', 'Hero Without a Class: Who Even Needs Skills?!', 'Kuzu Shichio', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/ebea2cf5-ce6c-4586-b2ad-a414fc7e0d22/5c469ab5-bb19-4717-bb11-0e6698f0d1f8.jpg', '"Classes" are given at the age of 10, and the presence or absence of "skills" greatly affect life. Arel, the son of "Sword Princess" Fara and "Magic King" Leon, has been branded as "Classless"... But even without a job or skills, Arel believes he can persevere through effort.', 'ongoing'),
  ('60e6eb5e-6798-4614-928f-064e65aabe16', 'An Observation Log of My Fiancée Who Calls Herself a Villainess', 'Shiki (しき) (Author)', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/60e6eb5e-6798-4614-928f-064e65aabe16/db104285-23b5-4d5c-b347-5794d2d834b6.jpg', 'Because Prince Cecil is extraordinarily intelligent, life is boring for him. His days are without much excitement, but he becomes engaged to Bertia, the daughter of a marquis. The first thing she says to him when they first meet is quite baffling. She claims she is the “villainous heroine” in the story of his life!! According to Bertia, she has memories of her previous life. In a certain “romance ', 'completed'),
  ('a990e445-7a43-454b-a062-ab34492f1308', 'My New Devil Wife', 'Shiryu', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/a990e445-7a43-454b-a062-ab34492f1308/7821412f-9dbf-43ec-89c2-4ddd1c83e491.jpg', 'Young orphaned adventurer tries summoning the devil to help his career as his own skills are lacking. The devil comes in form of a beauty who offers to grant him one wish. 
