  ('4e338970-63e8-489c-b937-5e7e3005e1e3', 'Mikoto-chan Doesn’t Want to Be Hated!', 'Pt', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/4e338970-63e8-489c-b937-5e7e3005e1e3/ab4118be-de43-47bb-8064-2c4a287ec05a.jpg', 'My beautiful, big-breasted childhood friend, Mikoto, is completely in love with me.
