  ('7350be91-b5e1-467d-89df-a089d014d20b', 'The Saint''s Magic Power is Omnipotent', 'Tachibana Yuka', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/7350be91-b5e1-467d-89df-a089d014d20b/4e1c3b76-293b-441f-b09e-7be97240fb76.jpg', 'Sei, a 20 year old office worker, is summoned to a different world after finishing some overtime work. But the person who had summoned her looks at her face and said, "This is not the Saint." Instead, the other summoned lady is lauded as the Saint, while Sei is ignored. Offended at being discarded without a second thought, Sei leaves the royal palace and looks for occupation, and she starts workin', 'ongoing'),
