  ('d41afbd7-3fbf-45b1-813c-b2d8244d69b2', 'Death March to the Parallel World Rhapsody', 'Ainana Hiro', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d41afbd7-3fbf-45b1-813c-b2d8244d69b2/ed975dbc-0f0d-4cfe-8287-199074e85a56.jpg', '29-year-old programmer Suzuki Ichirou finds himself transported into a fantasy RPG. Within the game, he''s a 15-year-old named Satou. At first he thinks he''s dreaming, but his experiences seem very real. Due to his use of a 3-time-use special power (meteor shower), he ends up wiping out an army of lizardmen and becoming very high level. He hides his level and plans to live peacefully and meet new p', 'ongoing'),
  ('bc20fa98-b707-43cc-b195-bcee8e518ed9', 'I''ll Become a Villainess Who Goes Down in History: It Seems Turning into a High-Born Baddie Makes the Prince All the More Lovestruck', 'Okido Izumi', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/bc20fa98-b707-43cc-b195-bcee8e518ed9/4178fc8e-bc85-4925-a503-705c1972071d.jpg', '"I don''t want a world full of only pretty things! I''ll become a villainess who will go down in history!!"

For someone who hates a typical "good girl" heroine, I was reincarnated as my favorite otome-game villainess! Since my wish has been granted, I''ll be the number one villainess who will go down in history! For that to happen, I need to be strong and intelligent! Also, although I''m just... doin', 'ongoing'),
  ('8e8b281f-a931-45c2-93e8-e350b0ed58b0', 'Dungeon Builder: The Demon King''s Labyrinth is a Modern City!', 'Tsukiyo Rui', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/8e8b281f-a931-45c2-93e8-e350b0ed58b0/d9cfd3a9-58ea-44f1-9280-be409a4944d3.jpg', 'Beings that create and control monsters and demons, beings that build and reign over malicious labyrinths, the chosen individuals to possess an overwhelming Unique Skill... They are the Demon Lords. Demon Lords entice people to come to the labyrinth they''ve built and eat the people’s despair as their nourishment. However, Creation Demon Lord Procell has decided that he will obtain people''s hopes a', 'completed'),
  ('d89cfcf7-dcb4-4af7-8c95-330c2c6167d0', 'The Return of the Corpse King: I, a Former Hero, Have Been Summoned Back to Isekai to Stop the CHUUNI Secret Society Organized by Me', 'Sty', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d89cfcf7-dcb4-4af7-8c95-330c2c6167d0/87f1a513-3976-481e-8244-163b9545e221.jpg', '"How can my past self get so excited doing all those embarrassing things?!"

When he was in the third year of middle school, Hizaki Shiou was summoned to another world to save it. After defeating the Demon King, he was forcibly returned back to the present day. Yet another three years later, he is summoned to the other world once again, this time to stop the rampage of the secret society "Helheim.', 'ongoing'),
  ('99182618-ae92-4aec-a5df-518659b7b613', 'Rebuild World', 'Nafuse', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/99182618-ae92-4aec-a5df-518659b7b613/a9d7c446-5aae-4668-832e-efbcb78dfddc.jpg', 'At the risk of his own life, a young man sets foot in the ruins of a devastated old world. His name is Akira, and in order to claw his way out of the hellhole that is his birthplace of Slumtown, the boy became a hunter. In the wastelands he happens upon a strange woman, standing perfectly still, stark naked.   
She is beautiful, but it seems that only he can see her. She exists incorporeal, tantal', 'ongoing'),
  ('6df29d13-2dab-4ca6-a0b5-74070abf3e1d', 'The One Within the Villainess', 'Makiburo', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/6df29d13-2dab-4ca6-a0b5-74070abf3e1d/86d993ca-f8fe-43e7-bf13-9b331750b428.jpg', 'In order to clear the name of ''Emi'', a girl who had reincarnated as Remilia, the villainess of an otome game, the real Remilia who had been watching all along inside awakens.', 'completed'),
  ('3787c114-b7ea-4cc1-8d7a-dc511eae002e', 'That Person. Later on…', 'Nahato', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/3787c114-b7ea-4cc1-8d7a-dc511eae002e/9d9e2df5-29e3-4518-8850-3be29e9d0024.jpg', 'Wazu was an ordinary townsman who shut himself off in "Mountain", because of an unfortunate course of events. After 2 years he decided to come down from the mountain to meet with people. But there are various misunderstanding about the "Mountain" which he shut himself off in. And then he meets with the people repeatedly. And after that...', 'hiatus'),
  ('024af7a5-f8ad-4b67-b950-b1708f52b018', 'There was a Cute Girl in the Hero''s Party, so I Tried Confessing to Her', 'Suisei', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/024af7a5-f8ad-4b67-b950-b1708f52b018/1c215af2-ae2d-4f6e-8b51-432bbd4fe9df.jpg', 'Youki was reincarnated in another world. However, instead of being reincarnated as the hero or the demon lord, he was instead reincarnated half-assedly as a minion of the Demon Lord. One day, the Hero''s Party attacked the Demon Lord''s castle with the intent of defeating the Demon Lord. Of course, Youki was able to repel their attempt with ease. In spite of this, he ended up falling for the cleric,', 'ongoing'),
  ('7898980b-1b23-4910-ac59-50f83c493b71', '777 Power Harem', 'Miki Nazuna', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/7898980b-1b23-4910-ac59-50f83c493b71/ce326b45-c319-4570-816c-5c810f498ef0.jpg', 'I drew a lottery at the Shopping District and won the privilege to go to another world. After drawing a lot of balls, unexpectedly I got a cheat-like skill. Silencing those who are noisy and getting hold of all the things that I want. I will satisfy all my desires.', 'ongoing'),
  ('0301208d-258a-444a-8ef7-66e433d801b1', 'I’m Gonna Live with You Not Because My Parents Left Me Their Debt But Because I Like You', 'Amane Megumi', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/0301208d-258a-444a-8ef7-66e433d801b1/9e94f337-f70e-4605-b55c-e11373157d9a.jpg', 'The main character, Yoshizumi Yuya, was being pressured into paying off the debt left by his parents who had fled abroad. It was his classmate, Hitotsuba Kaede, chosen as the cutest schoolgirl in Japan, who saved him from this crisis of life and death. However, there was a catch. The condition required to fulfill in return for taking over his debt was — "In return for the loan, you have – to live ', 'ongoing'),
  ('7722cc2c-cc19-4ca6-ac22-81bce771afe8', 'The Villainess'' Butler: Death Flag Destroyer at Your Service', 'Hiiro no Ame', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/7722cc2c-cc19-4ca6-ac22-81bce771afe8/4342c41f-4766-4af5-a0e4-f5103e2a973e.jpg', 'Regaining the memories of his previous life, Cyril realised he was reincarnated as the butler of Sophia, an otome game villain. At the rate things were going, Sophia would eventually have the prince stolen away from her by the heroine, fall into darkness, and be executed.

Wanting to save the villainous daughter he was so fond of, Cyril moved to eliminate all the factors that would cause her to fa', 'completed'),
  ('8a7992ca-634f-4625-ad41-8d2e75003f5b', 'Dad Is a Hero, Mom Is a Spirit, I''m a Reincarnator', 'Matsuura', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/8a7992ca-634f-4625-ad41-8d2e75003f5b/38b40354-d292-4794-9100-82044b196852.jpg', 'Well, I was reincarnated! And my father is a former hero? And my mother is a queen of the spirits!? With my knowledge of my past life and my powers in this world... I''ll protect my family''s happiness!', 'ongoing'),
  ('abd0bc20-063a-45a0-91b2-8b7049701d4a', 'The Reincarnation of the Strongest Exorcist in Another World', 'Kosuzu Kiichi', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/abd0bc20-063a-45a0-91b2-8b7049701d4a/e1ee3d07-402c-4db4-a92d-3629331e8a63.jpg', 'Haruyoshi Kuga''s power as the strongest exorcist is all for naught when he is betrayed by his closest ally. With his dying breath, he casts the secret Spell of Reincarnation — when he next opens his eyes, he finds himself in a different world altogether, reincarnated as Seika Lamprogue, the son of a family of magic scholars! He quickly learns that the magic in this new world is quite unlike the so', 'ongoing'),
  ('bc24c75e-1c73-43bc-80aa-024ebb041e34', 'You Like Me, Not My Daughter!?', 'Nozomi Kouta', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/bc24c75e-1c73-43bc-80aa-024ebb041e34/22642c39-7c3b-46ba-bf04-8f56c2e42e03.jpg', '"I will take in and raise this child."

I''m Katsuragi Ayako, thirty-\*BEEP\* years old. It''s been 10 years since I took in the daughter of my late sister and her husband. My daughter''s now in high school and is getting on well with her childhood friend, Aterazawa Takumi. Maybe they''ll start dating? Takumi''s a really nice guy, so I''m all for it. Eh? He has something to say to me? Is it something li', 'ongoing'),
  ('6f2b317e-17ff-491a-8f61-e6e591ae2df2', 'Akanabe-sensei Doesn''t Know About Embarrassment', 'Naoya Tajimi', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/6f2b317e-17ff-491a-8f61-e6e591ae2df2/c9549116-9b67-4ac5-9b88-02646ff65630.jpg', 'Kouki Sakieda is an assistant for Akira Akanabe, a manga artist he admires, who always tries to praise him in some way. Sakieda is worried that he will end up falling in love with her if this situation continues. Then Akanabe unexpectedly asks him to go out with her...', 'ongoing'),
  ('2356f5ff-143f-4e3b-96e6-9d9f5efab8c5', 'Apparently, Disillusioned Adventurers Will Save the World', 'Fuji Shinta', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/2356f5ff-143f-4e3b-96e6-9d9f5efab8c5/71d670ac-9057-42fc-a127-a0f145a6b9bc.jpg', 'Life isn’t going well for veteran adventurer Nick. Despite his loyalty to his party, he was betrayed by a teammate who accused him of embezzlement, then kicked out by his mentor. On top of that, his girlfriend dumped him too! Tired, heartbroken, and looking for a drink, Nick chances upon a few kindred spirits who are as jaded as he is. Can these disillusioned heroes put their faith in each other l', 'completed'),
  ('a53111bb-e36b-4abf-9de6-bd67b239bafc', 'Valhalla Penis Mansion', 'Gurashi', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/a53111bb-e36b-4abf-9de6-bd67b239bafc/26c2b0c8-9f8e-40ab-bb6e-6de0486bc5e3.jpg', 'Shota Iijima picked up a mysterious erotic book during his childhood. Since then he has developed a severe fantasy onee-san fetish. From the age of 12 to 15, he masturbated 999 times. For his 1000th round of masturbation, he had been transferred to a different world and was sold as a slave.', 'ongoing'),
  ('9a5b657d-b6db-45a7-a2b7-b165884d9603', 'Warrior Princess Survival Saga: The Unsanctioned Intergender Relations on a Deserted Island, Battling for the Fate of Another World', 'OTOSAMA', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/9a5b657d-b6db-45a7-a2b7-b165884d9603/020c088e-0539-426d-9319-8cacf9c37c92.jpg', 'Anastasia, an elf renowned as a once-in-a-millennium magical talent, faces the final battle of a three-way war in another world. In the midst of battle with her arch enemies, the demon race, Anastasia is enveloped in an intense light and, when she awakens, finds herself on an uninhabited island. As Anastasia strolls around the island, a mysterious human appears before her, but she can no longer us', 'ongoing'),
  ('e06e6024-9688-4a38-a8b4-6facd3fe1d80', 'Miss Regular Customer Wants to Enjoy', 'Shinmi Rin', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/e06e6024-9688-4a38-a8b4-6facd3fe1d80/ec699892-62df-4295-ab3e-cf3c2a89bcdc.jpg', 'Izumi, a university student part-timing at a manga cafe, got curious about a regular customer. Her name is Honami, a high school girl who''s been coming to the manga cafe recently. This defenseless and seemingly cute girl who he can''t take his eyes off of has a secret...!?', 'ongoing'),
  ('efb62763-c940-4495-aba5-69c192a999a4', 'Extremely Straightforward Boyfriend × Girlfriend', 'Fujita Nagisa', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/efb62763-c940-4495-aba5-69c192a999a4/09f7687e-e267-49f3-83f0-814073389bbd.jpg', 'Meet Shinichi Honda and Mako Wakamiya. One’s a boy, and the other’s a girl. But both don’t hesitate to say exactly what’s on their mind **IN CAPITAL LETTERS.**', 'completed'),
  ('837e01d6-f59b-4c2a-b9f7-68469215d0c6', 'Handyman Saitou in Another World', 'Ichitomo Kazutomo', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/837e01d6-f59b-4c2a-b9f7-68469215d0c6/8b020deb-1b79-4df5-99c2-934e54e7523f.jpg', 'Handyman Saitou has never been anyone special. All his life, he''s had average grades, ordinary athletic skill, a commonplace job... But his unremarkable path takes a turn when he wakes up in another world. Here, warriors, wizards, and elves accompany him on quests delving deep into dungeons, and Saitou realizes for the first time what it''s like to be needed. After all, who other than the handyman ', 'ongoing'),
  ('10fab94e-2227-47e2-b059-f4762eb5ca4e', 'Grandpa and Grandma Turn Young Again', 'Araido Kagiri', 'https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/10fab94e-2227-47e2-b059-f4762eb5ca4e/95fba811-36f6-4360-a95d-c52cd86be427.jpg', 'This story is about Ine and Shouzou, two pensioners well into their 80s who are mysteriously returned to their 20s one night.', 'completed')
